Scope
-----
This licence covers the derived measurements and metadata in this directory
(the CSV, Parquet and JSON files): positions, velocities, pose angles, clock
readings, quality-control metrics and the video registry.

It does not cover, and grants no rights in:
- the NFL broadcast footage the measurements were taken from, which remains the
  property of the National Football League and is not distributed here;
- the broadcast stills and GIFs in docs/img/, which are NFL footage reproduced at
  reduced resolution for research illustration.

The code in src/ and notebooks/ is licensed separately under the MIT License
(see LICENSE at the repository root).

